              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kelly Jones"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious but be aware or portion size. I made this for a football party and no one even noticed the low fat version as it's so good, but plan on a 9X13 or larger pan for this many ingredients. I use a regular white corning ware dish and had to half the tomato, green onions, olives and sour cream mixture. Thanks for this excellent recipe I will make again!"
